OL,3,GNEWSAPrincess of Wales picks up
OL,4,Apassenger, 94, on bus
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Princess of Wales has helped pick
OL,7,Fup a 94-year-old rural minibus user as
OL,8,Fshe celebrated the 50th anniversary of
OL,9,Fthe service.
OL,11,FCatherine travelled to the village of
OL,12,FPulborough to mark the milestone
OL,13,Foccasion for the West Sussex Minibus,
OL,14,Fwhose team of volunteers transport the
OL,15,Felderly across the area in a fleet of
OL,16,Fvehicles.
OL,18,FStella Drewett, 94, said before the
OL,19,Fprincess arrived that she was not fazed
OL,20,Fby anything, and joked: "When they said
OL,21,F'It will be a celebrity,' I said 'I
OL,22,Fdon't know any celebrities'."
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,329,320,200,140,0,100
