OL,3,GNEWSAPrincess of Wales picks up
OL,4,Apassenger, 94, on bus
OL,5,
OL,6,FCatherine had been picked up by the
OL,7,Fminibus in the village and arrived at
OL,8,Fthe home of the retired school cook
OL,9,Fbefore helping her board the bus.
